[[Category:American stage actors|Parks, Larry]]
[[Category:Best Actor Oscar Nominee|Parks, Larry]]
[[Category:Hollywood blacklist|Parks, Larry]]
[[Category:People from Kansas|Parks, Larry]]</text>
    </revision>
