      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox Film
 | name = The Jolson Story 
 | image = Jolson_Story_dvd.jpg
 | caption = DVD cover of ''The Jolson Story''
 | director = [[Alfred E. Green]]	
 | producer = [[Sidney Skolsky]]		
