* [http://europa.eu.int/smartapi/cgi/sga_doc?smartapi!celexapi!prod!CELEXnumdoc&amp;lg=EN&amp;numdoc=32001L0113&amp;model=guichett Council Directive 2001/113/EC (20 December 2001)]

