      <text xml:space="preserve">'''AMBA''', the '''Association of MBAs''', is an [[UK]] based organization that accredits [[MBA]] programs of international [[business school]]s, similar to the [[AACSB]] in the [[USA]].

The list of schools with programs [[School accreditation|accredited]] by AMBA can be seen in the link provided below. Some of these schools have obtained [[EQUIS]] accreditation in recognition of their overall outstanding performance.

