* Hagedorn, Ann. ''Beyond The River: The Untold Story of the Heroes of the Underground Railroad''. Simon &amp; Schuster, 2002. ISBN 0684870657.
* Mayer, Henry.  ''All on Fire: William Lloyd Garrison and the Abolition of Slavery.''ISBN 0312253672.
* Laurie, Bruce &lt;i&gt;Beyond Garrison&lt;/i&gt;. New York: Cambridge University Press, 2005. ISBN 0521605172.

