      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Calder''' can refer to:

*[[Alexander Calder]], an American artist
*[[Calder Park]], in [[Victoria (Australia)|Victoria]], [[Australia]]
*The [[River Calder]], a river in the United Kingdom
*The [[Calder Memorial Trophy]], a trophy presented to the best rookie of the year in the NHL

